Ported code
-----------

Parts of this repository are ported from Basis Universal, by Binomial LLC:

  Version:  v2.50
  Tag:      v2_50
  Commit:   9bebe16726b3a61c8c213eeee3b7cffb462ef34e
  Source:   https://github.com/BinomialLLC/basis_universal
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0 (kept as LICENSE-APACHE-UPSTREAM)
  Copyright (C) 2019-2026 Binomial LLC. All Rights Reserved.

Ported (and modified: translated from C++ to Rust) from
transcoder/basisu_transcoder.cpp, transcoder/basisu_transcoder_uastc.h,
transcoder/basisu_dds_transcoder.inl,
encoder/basisu_uastc_enc.cpp, encoder/basisu_bc7enc.cpp,
encoder/basisu_etc.h and encoder/basisu_etc.cpp:

  src/uastc/tables.rs   the UASTC mode tables, partition patterns, anchors and
                        seeds, ASTC integer-sequence and unquantisation tables
  src/uastc/unpack.rs   unpack_uastc (block reading and reference decode),
                        astc_interpolate, get_anchor_indices
  src/uastc/astc.rs     pack_astc_block, pack_astc_solid_block,
                        transcode_uastc_to_astc and their bit-packing helpers
  src/uastc/bc7.rs      transcode_uastc_to_bc7, determine_shared_pbits,
                        determine_unique_pbits, encode_bc7_block, the BC7
                        partition, anchor and mode tables, the BC7 part of
                        uastc_init, bc7u::unpack_bc7 (BC7 decode)
  src/uastc/cell.rs     color_cell_compression (ASTC endpoints),
                        color_cell_compression_est_astc, the least-squares
                        and one-colour helpers, astc_init and the parts of
                        bc7enc_compress_block_init they use
  src/uastc/bc1.rs      encode_bc1 (one pass), encode_bc1_solid_block, the
                        BC1 single-colour tables, transcode_uastc_to_bc1_hint0
                        and _hint1, bcu::unpack_bc1 (BC1 decode)
  src/uastc/etc.rs      the etc_block accessors, pack_etc1_block_solid_color
                        and its tables, g_etc2_eac_tables, apply_etc1_bias
  src/uastc/encode.rs   encode_uastc (effort levels 0-2), pack_uastc, the
                        astc_mode* searches, estimate_partition2(_list),
                        compute_bc1_hints, compute_etc1_hints,
                        uastc_pack_eac_a8

